<title>UK: Rabobank sets 2.0 bln rand zero coupon 20-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 2.0 bln rand zero coupon 20-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Toronto Dominion and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN RAND  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    07.AUG.17</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  8.30	PAY DATE    07.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  40 BP     REOFFER    8.05	SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/AMST  PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     MGT/UND   15 BP	SELL CONC  25 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
